<DocsLayout title="Architecture — sum">
  <div class="doc">
    <h1>Architecture</h1>
    <p class="lede">Sum distributes working instructions. Your existing agent is the lead, native HC handles communication and terminal processes, and Git provides checkout isolation.</p>
<div class="sec">
<h2>Working roles</h2>
<div class="cells roles"><div><h3>lead</h3><p>The current conversation owns the approved task and may implement directly or delegate useful bounded work.</p></div><div><h3>helper</h3><p>A brief defines the role, allowed edits, candidate, checks, report path, and immediate parent. Reading entry instructions does not promote a helper.</p></div><div><h3>reviewer</h3><p>Independently inspects a stable candidate, saves concrete findings, and explicitly sends the result to its parent.</p></div></div><p>One active lead per workspace and one source writer per checkout are operating rules, not enforced locks. Use separate worktrees for concurrent writers.</p>
</div>
<div class="sec">
<h2>Small written checkpoints</h2>
<p>Keep one task note with goal, scope, worktree, candidate, helper addresses, reports, decisions, and next action. Each helper saves its own report outside disposable worktrees. Preserve unfinished work and actual user decisions.</p><p><a href={repoBlob("templates/task.md")}> Task-note template ↗</a></p>
</div>
<div class="sec">
<h2>Native communication</h2>
<p>Use native <code>hc run --bg</code>, <code>hc send</code>, and <code>hc wait</code> according to the installed manual. Native parent defaults retain notifications and parent-linked lifetime. Ordinary command exits notify the lead; an interactive agent must save and explicitly send its report.</p><p>A successful send, idle status, or a stopped child does not establish completion. Inspect actual output and account for every required result against the final stable candidate.</p>
</div>
<div class="sec">
<h2>Resume deliberately</h2>
<p>After interruption, inspect the real program, current recipient, worktrees, and reports before sending or relaunching. A restored shell at the same address does not restore an agent conversation. Uncertain startup calls for inspection before recovery.</p><p><a href={repoBlob("skills/sum-resume/SKILL.md")}> Resume procedure ↗</a></p>
</div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
